@startuml
title P2 codec/player spike proof flow
autonumber

actor Researcher
participant "Fixture corpus" as Fixtures
participant "Range harness\nstream_variants" as Harness
participant "Candidate adapter" as Candidate
participant "Current node scheduler\nready/resume_at" as Scheduler
participant "Metrics collector" as Metrics

Researcher -> Fixtures: Select 2h MP3/AAC/Opus case
Researcher -> Harness: Publish variant + auth token
Candidate -> Harness: GET bytes with Range
Harness --> Candidate: Partial content chunks
Candidate -> Candidate: Incremental decode into bounded buffer
Candidate -> Scheduler: ready when decoder + buffer threshold hold
Scheduler -> Candidate: resume_at(T_coord)
Candidate -> Metrics: Record first-audio time, RSS, bytes fetched

Researcher -> Candidate: pause
Researcher -> Candidate: seek(position)
Candidate -> Harness: More range reads for seek
Researcher -> Candidate: resume
Candidate -> Metrics: Record seek-to-audio, post-seek RSS, and skew

alt Candidate passes
  Candidate -> Metrics: Emit comparable artifact bundle
else Candidate fails
  Candidate -> Metrics: Emit rejected-option evidence with exact failure mode
end

Metrics --> Researcher: Side-by-side evidence for ADR
@enduml
